abstract: >-
  Exact reproducibility archive for a proof that every finite group that is
  the product of every pair of its non-conjugate maximal subgroups is
  soluble. The archive contains the manuscript, partial Lean and Rocq
  formalizations, a Comparator interface, GAP certificates, independent
  Python checks, source maps, and pinned computational inputs.
